{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"chess-opening-trainer UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"chess-opening-trainer.copy.howAnswer","keys":["chess-opening-trainer.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Chagua ufunguzi na kucheza kama Nyeusi au Nyeupe. Chagua moja ya vipande vyako, kisha eneo lake la mwisho. Hatua sahihi huendelea na mstari; hatua ya nje ya mstari hufutwa na hatua inayotarajiwa inaonyeshwa. Matumizi ya Hint kuonyesha hatua inayofuata au mstari mpya wa kuanza tena.","record_id":"a7d4ba6ca106ee28717027ba8f94ee5b3e410b147d8b3f23dda26e38903f680f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.7234862520000434,"source":"Choose an opening and play as White or Black. Select one of your pieces, then its destination square. Correct moves continue the line; an off-line move is undone and the expected move is shown. Use Hint to highlight the next move or New line to restart.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"cd249516455d6d39bceccf7775939abc8f8a307fec2f51bcbdc411b0d6834557","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Chagua ufunguzi na kucheza kama Nyeusi au Nyeupe. Chagua moja ya vipande vyako, kisha eneo lake la mwisho. Hatua sahihi huendelea na mstari; hatua ya nje ya mstari hufutwa na hatua inayotarajiwa inaonyeshwa. Matumizi ya Hint kuonyesha hatua inayofuata au mstari mpya wa kuanza tena.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
